  "entries": [
    "Plants or fungi burst out or quickly grow, entangling creatures. The surfaces in the area counts as terrain. Each round that a creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure, it is also immobilized for 1 round. Creatures can attempt to Escape to remove these effects."
